## Risk Assessment

| Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|------------|--------|------------|
| pgcrypto extension missing | Low | High | Check Supabase extensions before deploy |
| Long retry delays | Medium | Low | Capped at 15 min via retryLimit=5 |
